# Plan an action sequence whose imagined future reaches a goal image.
#
# A learning-free episodic World Model (retrieval dynamics over a memory of real
# transitions + a CEM planner) imagines candidate action rollouts in latent
# space and returns the one that lands closest to the goal -- visual foresight
# to an image goal ("World Model版 Nav2").

sensor_msgs/Image goal_image       # the image to reach
sensor_msgs/Image current_image    # the current observation
uint32 horizon                     # plan length in steps (0 -> node default)
---
ActionCondition planned_action     # the planned action sequence
float32 final_cost                 # goal cosine distance achieved (lower = closer)
float32 start_cost                 # goal distance from the start (for context)
bool success
